hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22686","Abu al-Nadr narrated to us, Abu Ja'far narrated to us, from Yahya al-Bakka, from Abu Rafi', who said: I used to craft for the wives of the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, then they narrated to me that they heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: Gold for gold and silver for silver, weight for weight; whoever adds or seeks addition has dealt in usury."
